<title>HONG KONG: Paliburg/China Overseas takes Stanley site - sources.</title>
<headline>Paliburg/China Overseas takes Stanley site - sources.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Paliburg Holdings Ltd led consortium bought the Stanley site for HK$5.5 billion, market sources said.</p>
<p>Sources said the consortium was 40 percent owned by Paliburg, 30 percent by Paliburg's subsidiary Regal Hotels International Holdings Ltd, and another 30 percent by China Overseas Land &amp; Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>Paliburg has confirmed it was a buyer, but officials from the other two companies could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
